# Illustrative template: supply the OMol25 custom def2-TZVPD basis via %basis
# and replace charge, multiplicity and coordinates with a real configuration.
# Spin handling and broken-symmetry starts must follow the dataset protocol.
! wB97M-V EnGrad RIJCOSX def2/J NoUseSym DIIS NOSOSCF NormalConv DEFGRID3
%scf
  Convergence Tight
  maxiter 300
  THRESH 1e-12
  TCUT 1e-13
end
# Add the appropriate custom basis definition and spin setup here.
* xyz CHARGE MULTIPLICITY
  # ELEMENT X Y Z (angstrom)
*
